@startuml agentic-service-operations-boundary
title Agentic Service vs Agentic Operations Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Agentic Operations" as aops
class "Agentic Service" as asvc

aops --> asvc : contains (one or more)

note right of aops
  Agentic operating mode
  for ongoing operational activity
end note

note right of asvc
  Service-level delivery
  or interaction
end note

note bottom
  Agentic Operations do NOT
  make every Service Agentic
  per ADR-ES-014 §9
  per ASVC-NEG-004
end note
@enduml
